WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.100
Bombardier beetle: Pheropsophus jessoensis

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.640
When under threat, these beetles release

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.140
a hot chemical spray.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.740
Slow motion

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.120
Japanese common toad: Bufo japonicus

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.480
Researchers could hear the sound of the spray — inside the toad

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
88 minutes later

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:54.020
Toad and beetle part ways, both unharmed.

